## Re-run 2026-10-04: the same 41 checks, now on a schedule the repository owns

The deployment contract did not move between the run above and this one. What moved is who
runs it. `scripts/web-deployment-in-docker.sh` is now named on an executable line of
`.github/workflows/docker-labs.yml`, a job that fires at 03:17 UTC every day and can also be
started by hand, and `scripts/ci/check-lab-coverage.py` is the rule that refuses a lab named
by nobody. This run is that scheduled command run by hand, at 15:44 +0800, on the tree at
`36d0809e`, which is 70 commits past `0e89f3fc` -- the commit that added this lab and the
transcript above together.

